name 'aif-y2-natural-language-processing-postassessment-q6-2026'

right '"pancakes", because it is frequent in Chapter 3 and rare in the rest of the book'
wrong '"butter", because it appears more often in Chapter 3'
wrong '"butter", because a keyword should appear in every chapter'
wrong 'Neither word, because a keyword always has to be the most frequent word in its chapter'

allow_multiple_attempts true

markdown <<MARKDOWN
An author is picking a keyword for Chapter 3 of a ten-chapter cookbook.

| Word | Times in Chapter 3 | Chapters it appears in |
|---|---|---|
| butter | 6 | 10 |
| pancakes | 3 | 1 |

Which word is the better keyword for Chapter 3, and why?
MARKDOWN

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 5: Keyword Extraction
MARKDOWN
